0 FILE 7327 - Scorpion Pyramid
0 A large ancient-Egyptian pyramid diorama built on a raised hieroglyph-decorated baseplate, featuring a mechanized scorpion, a car, tomb interior with sarcophagus, decorative obelisks, hieroglyph-covered walls and doors, plus mummy and Anubis guard minifigures.
0 Name: 7327 - Scorpion Pyramid
0 Author: Christian Neumann [Wesley]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under CCAL version 2.0 : see CAreadme.txt

0 !THEME Pharaoh's Quest

0 !HISTORY 2017-03-05 [Wesley] creation


